Yet Another Nethack Bug?

A weird thing just occurred, while playing on NAO.
I was credit cloning in a general shop, and, within the process, just
lifting zorkmids
"You have a little trouble lifting 4001 gold pieces.--More--"
then network error!
OK, no problem, just reconnect.
Then guess what? was carrying $4001, and on the floor just under me,
also $4001!

OK, just try again. Drop $. lift $.
"You have a little trouble lifting 8002 gold pieces.--More--"
Close putty... Reconnect...
Guess what: 16004 gold pieces are now available.
...then 32008. And all created gold pieces are mine!.

I've tried to reproduce the same behavior with items other than $, but
no success.
It also seems not to work outside of a shop.So probably linked to the
shop credit handling.
I've tried locally (windows) in wizard mode, killing the process after
the --More-- message: same bug after recovering the game.
So most probably a nethack bug,  and I cannot find it referenced here
or on the nethack website. (would be my second official bug in 20
years playing nethack. Hurrah!)

I hate finding a so cheaty bug, because I know I will have
difficulties not to using it!
(and at least the $ contest during NAO june tournament is to be
stopped!)


